  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p><p><b>Mystery boxes</b> appear randomly in <a href=\"/wiki/hay-day-8519\" title=\"Hay Day\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hay Day</a> and contain various items. There are several different types of boxes.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mystery tool boxes</b></span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> area, mystery red toolboxes chained to the ground could appear. If the box is locked (which is often the case), players can unlock it by spending <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. However, in rare instances (1 in 4), players might stumble upon a box that is already unlocked. Once the box has been opened or rejected, it trembles back into the ground.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c8/Probabilities_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20180427153139\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Probabilities icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Probabilities icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Probabilities icon</figcaption></figure> \n<p>Players can check the probabilities of the box containing certain items by tapping on the dice icon in the top left corner of the pop-up.&#160;&#160;Prizes include <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boosters</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Ordinary box</b></span></h4>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/87/Mystery_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028142652\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mystery tool box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mystery tool box\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Mystery tool box</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Ordinary boxes can be with opened with 3 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.&#160; The top prize is 5 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Big box</b></span></h4>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3f/Big_Mystery_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20201017203356\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Big mystery tool box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Big mystery tool box\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"114\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Big mystery tool box</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Big boxes can be with opened with 10 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.&#160;&#160;The top prize is 13&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Huge box</b></span></h4>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/aa/Huge_Mystery_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20201017203831\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Huge mystery tool box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Huge mystery tool box\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"118\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Huge mystery tool box</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Huge boxes can be with opened with 20&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.&#160;The top prize is 25 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-permit-27088\" title=\"Expansion Permit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Expansion permits</a> are found in huge boxes.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Treasure chests</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/32/Treasure_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028142659\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Treasure chest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Treasure chest\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Treasure chest</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Treasure chests</b> appear in the <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a> lake. Locked chests can be opened by spending 5 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Once the chest has been opened or rejected, it sinks into the water.\n</p><p>Players can check the probabilities of the chest containing certain items by tapping on the dice icon in the top left corner of the pop-up. Prizes include <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/puzzle-piece-28177\" title=\"Puzzle Piece\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">puzzle pieces</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">boosters</a>. The top prize is 8 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Seasonal mystery gifts </b></span></h3>\n<p>Seasonal mystery gifts appear in the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-7449\" title=\"Fishing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fishing</a> area when a seasonal <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">theme</a> is on: <b>a ghost</b> appears around Halloween, <b>present boxes</b> appear around Christmas, <b>firework barrels</b> appear around New Year's and Chinese New Year's. These are never locked.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHalloween_Ghost.png\" title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/9d/Halloween_Ghost.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171024182306\" title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Halloween Ghost.png (147 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AMystery_Present.png\" title=\"Mystery Present.png (38 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/b/b6/Mystery_Present.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171024190755\" title=\"Mystery Present.png (38 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Mystery Present.png (38 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AMystery_Fireworks.png\" title=\"Mystery Fireworks.png (93 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Mystery_Fireworks.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20171024183506\" title=\"Mystery Fireworks.png (93 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Mystery Fireworks.png (93 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Each gift can contain a <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supply item</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lure</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">voucher</a>, a <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">seasonal decoration</a>, 1 to 3 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> or the Secret Coffin, a special <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decoration</a> given by the Halloween ghost.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Don't forget to check for Treasure Chests. Many of us find Mystery Boxes on the farms of other players, but don't forget to look in their towns to find Treasure Chests floating off shore.</li>\n<li>If a Mystery Tool Box is found on your own farm, it is very likely for one to be found on another farm at the same time.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830153853\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 460/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 74/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3838/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.527      1 -total\n 19.94%    2.697      1 Template:Languages\n 11.16%    1.510      5 Template:Clr\n 10.10%    1.367      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:6452-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260830153853 and revision id 105310. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
